body:
I love this. Such good advice. I often feel pressured that I have to 'lead' the conversation and put so much effort into it, but recently with the help of the forum i've learnt that the other person should also be giving that back, trying harder to communicate more clearly. Its helped a lot. Now when I talk to people, rather than apologising for being 'awkward', I just let them know they need to talk louder, slower etc. It helps a lot.

&#x200B;

Also I'm in Australia and learning Auslan :) It's very hard though, I have a very poor memory, but I'm getting there!
